This directory contains the files "PEGASE.2.tar.gz" and "stellibLCBcor.tar.gz".
You have to "gunzip" them and then to "untar" them.
E.g.,
	gunzip PEGASE.2.tar.gz
and 
	tar xvf PEGASE.2.tar
.

The contents of the .tar files will be put in a directory called "PEGASE.2".
Look at the README file to know how to run the code.

